{"data":{"body":"[P1] Wait for the submitted statement to finish. Redshift Data API's `executeStatement` returns after queueing asynchronous work, so later SQL or permission failures are lost; an older RUNNING merge can also finish after the terminal merge and overwrite it. Poll `DescribeStatement` to a terminal status with a bounded timeout, surface failures, document the additional IAM action, and add ordering/failure tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7u-iyR","finding_digest":"ca6ef2a49f7cd4c80e3f1e5600a70a3102f670dece60a8620ff896830d3989d0","finding_id":"arf_v1_zjxpfje7ptkmqdr7dzlabjykge","finding_key":"insight-plugin/redshiftexporter::export::terminal-statement-ordering","identity_key":"insight-plugin/redshiftexporter::export::terminal-statement-ordering","line":114,"observation_digest":"ba64c451fe25d88fde9a906c6379f4dff4a5e02cfc6a966561ad0528b3504d7b","observation_id":"aro_v1_xjsmiup6exmi7xu2sbwgg6pu37","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/RedshiftExporter.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zjxpfje7ptkmqdr7dzlabjykge","published_at":"2026-09-14T20:38:02Z","review_id":"arr_v1_73go55s6yw7ve2tkufpklz322d","reviewed_base_sha":"7f1a73ca16308d31a1e5a270e504676caf890e0b","reviewed_head_sha":"c66fb370169b3201ca753b03a7ecf3c4f45d8f8f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":106,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":704},"record_id":"art_v1_snujfug3trdjhbo7t5zpozie5b","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-14T20:38:02Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
